---
description: Generate MCP servers with make-mcp when the user asks for an MCP server for a library, product or API
alwaysApply: false
---

Use the `make-mcp` MCP server for this. Follow its `create_mcp` prompt:
detect_context → ask the returned questions (pre-select defaults, never answer for the user) → submit_answers →
preview_plan and wait for an explicit yes → (only if asked: extract_api → extract the operations yourself as JSON,
verbatim quotes, nothing invented → submit_extraction, for every task) → generate_server → test_server → register_server (show diff, apply only
after agreement). Never ask for secret values in chat.
